<title>USA: Fortune Financial names president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Fortune Financial names president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONGWOOD, Fla. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortune Financial Systems Inc said Wednesday it has appointed Roger Royce as president and chief executive, succeeding James Byrd, who will remain chairman.</p>
<p>In addition, Byrd has been named vice chairman of Success Magazine, and therefore will relinquish the day-to-day operations of the company.</p>
<p>Royce, is the former president and chief executive of Motel 6, Woodfin Suites, and chief operations officer of Fotomat.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
